{"id":"F-T45-1","kind":"failure","title":"Next morning 'log option a' (a plan for last night's remaining protein): logged for today","criteria":[2,6],"severity":"medium","fern_did":"Logged the 1.5-serving ON Plant Protein shake as today's entry; Sam had to say it was for yesterday's dinner.","should_have":"Option A was the plan for last night's remaining macros: log it for yesterday as dinner, or ask yesterday-or-today as a choice.","seen":"2026-11-04","maybe_fixed_by":null,"history":[{"role":"me","text":"how to fill in my protein with my remaining calories","at":"2026-11-03T19:19:59+08:00"},{"role":"sol","text":"Your ON Plant Protein: 1 serving (40 g) = 150 kcal, 24 g protein, 6 g carbs, 3.5 g fat. You have 91 kcal left, so a full shake blows the calorie budget — but it's about getting your 43 g protein in.\n\nTwo workable fills for your remaining 43 g today:\n\nOption A — ON Plant Protein only. 1.5 servings (60 g) = 225 kcal, 36 g protein. You'd overshoot calories by ~134 kcal but under carb limit. Leaves you ~7 g short of protein.\n\nOption B — ON + your tilapia. 1 serving ON (150 kcal, 24 g) + the rest of the fried tilapia (your ~67 g edible part ≈ 90 kcal, ~19 g protein) = 240 kcal, ~43 g protein. Nails the protein, but pushes you ~149 kcal over and carbs are already maxed.\n\nHonest read: you can't hit 43 g protein in only 91 kcal — fat and carbs are already at/over target today (fat over by 6 g, carbs over by 4 g). Today is basically a write-off for a clean macro finish; both options overshoot calories and fat.\n\nIf you just want protein in (not clean): go Option B, tilapia's the leaner hit. Want me to log it?","at":"2026-11-03T19:20:13+08:00"}],"records":{"task":[{"id":"@r16e0730878","reschedule_count":1,"sort_order":12,"tags":["main work","Chris"],"due_date":"2026-11-04","starred":false,"original_due":"2026-11-01","title":"Create current infra and list of tools available to the AI chat agent in Northwind app","parse_state":"parsed","status":"open","source"